title: An Evening on TVP
subtitle: Turn government television into public leverage—or supply the clip it booked you for.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_negotiation_card
frequency: 140
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and government_party = "pis" and public_media_patron = "pis" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_tvp_appearance_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_tvp_appearance_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/hostile-interview.webp

= An evening on TVP

TVP offers Lewica a prime-time chair. PiS does not need our votes tonight. It
does want ratings, an opposition quarrel and footage suggesting that its social
programme sets the terms for everyone. We want an audience the party cannot
reach on its own.

Current leverage: **[+ negotiation_leverage +]/100**. Media preparation:
**[+ media_capacity +]/100**. This is a contest over the frame, not a coalition
meeting.

- @live
- @dossier
- @conditions

@live
title: Accept only a live, unedited interview
subtitle: Free. At 24 media capacity, bargaining capital +9; below it, −5.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.media_capacity >= 24) {
    Q.hostile_interview_success = 1;
    Q.negotiation_capital += 9;
    Q.public_trust += 3;
    Q.media_access += 4;
    Q.issue_ownership += 2;
    Q.winner_reputation += 2;
    Q.left_poll += 0.3;
    Q.pis_relation -= 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        "A live TVP ambush gives Lewica an audience and a bargaining asset";
} else {
    Q.hostile_interview_success = 0;
    Q.negotiation_capital -= 5;
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.media_access -= 2;
    Q.winner_reputation -= 3;
    Q.party_unity -= 2;
    Q.pis_relation -= 2;
    Q.coalition_blur += 2;
    Q.news_headline =
        "TVP turns an unprepared Lewica appearance into government footage";
}
!}

[? if hostile_interview_success: The presenter interrupts, but the guest keeps
returning to one material demand. TVP's evening package remains hostile; its
audience has nevertheless heard an answer that PiS must now address.?]
[? if not hostile_interview_success: The booking outruns the briefing. One
answer is cut into a government montage, while Lewica's factions spend the week
arguing over who authorised the appearance.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@dossier
title: Bring one costed social demand and repeat it through the interruptions
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Bargaining capital +7 and media access +3; TVP credits PiS for the issue.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A costed demand and broadcast briefing require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; negotiation_capital += 7; media_capacity += 2; media_access += 3; labor_credibility += 2; public_trust += 1; pis_relation += 2; coalition_blur += 3; progressives_dissent += 2; last_policy_stage = "Opposition demand on government television"; last_policy_authority = "PiS cabinet retains implementation authority"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Lewica leaves TVP with one social demand the cabinet must answer"

The format protects the government: every proposal is introduced as an answer
to PiS policy. Repetition still turns one demand into a public benchmark. We
gain leverage and accept that TVP will blur who supplied the idea.

- #poland_card_finish

@conditions
title: Leave the chair empty and publish the conditions for a fair interview
subtitle: Bargaining capital +1 and opposition clarity; media access −3.
on-arrival: negotiation_capital += 1; media_access -= 3; pis_relation -= 2; ko_relation += 1; progressive_credibility += 2; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "Lewica publishes TVP's terms and leaves the government an empty chair"

The refusal denies TVP a guest it can edit into the government story. It also
denies Lewica the audience. The public conditions create a little pressure, not
the reach that a successful appearance could have won.

- #poland_card_finish
